   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "057087a6-a7f5-42ad-b082-423873a3c420",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "From this graph, we have a slight elbow point at K=10, and we also have very little variation in losses, so K=10 seems like a reasonable number of clusters for this data set."
   ]
